      "label": "each kind of capital asset: months held to be long-term (s.2(42A) - 12 for listed securities other than units, equity-fund units and zero-coupon bonds, 24 for the rest), the bucket short / long, grandfathering (112A), the indexation option (land / building), s.50C, s.50AA (debt funds bought from 1 April 2023, market-linked debentures, unlisted bonds / debentures sold from 23 July 2024: always short-term at the slab rates) and the exemptions it may claim"
    },
    {
      "name": "grandfather_before",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "2018-02-01",
      "label": "112A grandfathering (s.55(2)(ac)): bought before this day - cost is the higher of cost and the lower of FMV on 31-01-2018 and the sale value"
    },
    {
      "name": "index_before",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "2024-07-23",
      "label": "proviso to s.112(1)(a): land / building bought before this day, by a resident individual / HUF - tax is the lower of 12.5% without indexation and 20% with it"
    },
    {
      "name": "rate_indexed",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 20,
      "label": "proviso to s.112(1)(a): the rate with indexation"
    },
    {
      "name": "index_residents_only",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": true,
      "label": "the indexation choice is for residents only (rule 570 of the ITR-2 validations)"
    },
    {
      "name": "s50c_tolerance_pct",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 10,
      "label": "s.50C: the stamp-duty value is the sale value only when it is more than 110% of what was received"
    },
    {
      "name": "cii_base_year",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 2001,
      "label": "s.48 / s.55(2)(b): a capital asset bought before 1 April 2001 - cost is its FMV on that day, indexed from 2001-02"
    },
    {
      "name": "cap_54",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 100000000,
      "label": "s.54 / s.54F: the cost of the new house counted, at most (Finance Act 2023)"
    },
    {
      "name": "cap_54ec",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 5000000,
      "label": "s.54EC: bonds within 6 months, at most 50 lakh in the year and the next"
    },
    {
      "name": "f54_houses_max",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 1,
      "label": "s.54F: not more than one other residential house owned on the day of transfer (other than the new one)"
    },
    {
      "name": "ec_months",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 6,
      "label": "s.54EC: the bonds are bought within this many months of the transfer"
    },
    {
      "name": "stcl_order",
      "type": "json",
      "default": [
        "stcg_app",
        "stcg_111a",
        "ltcg_112",
        "ltcg_112a"
      ],
      "label": "s.70(2) / s.74(1)(a): a short-term loss is set off against these gains, in this order (slab-rate gains first, the 1.25 lakh 112A exemption last)"
    },
    {
      "name": "ltcl_order",
      "type": "json",
      "default": [
        "ltcg_112",
        "ltcg_112a"
      ],
      "label": "s.70(3) / s.74(1)(b): a long-term loss only against long-term gains, in this order"
    },
    {
      "name": "loss_years",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 8,
      "label": "s.74 / s.71B: a loss is carried forward for 8 assessment years"
    },
    {
      "name": "cf_kinds",
      "type": "json",
      "default": [
        "original",
        "revised"
      ],
      "label": "s.80 / s.139(3): a capital loss is carried forward only when the return is filed by the due date (an original, or its revision)"
    },
    {
      "name": "hp_cf_any",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": true,
      "label": "s.80 does not name s.71B: a house-property loss is carried forward from a belated return too"
    },
    {
      "name": "ex_before_months",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 12,
      "label": "s.54 / 54F: a house bought within 1 year before the transfer ..."
    },
    {
      "name": "ex_after_months",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 24,
      "label": "s.54 / 54F: ... or 2 years after it"
    },
    {
      "name": "build_months",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 36,
      "label": "s.54 / 54F: a house built within 3 years after the transfer"
    },
    {
      "name": "cgas_by",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "07-31",
      "label": "s.54(2) / 54F(4): the gain not used by the due date of the return u/s 139(1) is deposited in the Capital Gains Accounts Scheme by that day - 31 July of the AY for one whose accounts are not audited (the only kind My return files)"
    },
    {
      "name": "ex_max",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 4,
      "label": "exemptions claimed against one sale (54 and 54EC on one house ...), at most"
    }
  ],
  "expr": {
    "vop": "record",
    "fields": {
      "assets": "$assets",
      "grandfather_before": "$grandfather_before",
      "index_before": "$index_before",
      "rate_indexed": "$rate_indexed",
      "index_residents_only": "$index_residents_only",
      "s50c_tolerance_pct": "$s50c_tolerance_pct",
      "cii_base_year": "$cii_base_year",
      "cap_54": "$cap_54",
      "cap_54ec": "$cap_54ec",
      "f54_houses_max": "$f54_houses_max",
      "ec_months": "$ec_months",
      "stcl_order": "$stcl_order",
      "ltcl_order": "$ltcl_order",
      "loss_years": "$loss_years",
      "cf_kinds": "$cf_kinds",
      "hp_cf_any": "$hp_cf_any",
      "ex_before_months": "$ex_before_months",
      "ex_after_months": "$ex_after_months",
      "build_months": "$build_months",
      "cgas_by": "$cgas_by",
      "ex_max": "$ex_max"
    }
  },
  "returns": "record",
  "version": 2,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "2026-10-07: The capital-gains rules My return works by (Finance (No.2) Act 2024; AY 2026-27): holding periods, buckets, grandfathering, the indexation choice for land / building bought before 23 July 2024, s.50C, s.50AA, exemption caps, set-off order and carry-forward. 2026-10-08: ex_before_months / ex_after_months / build_months (s.54, 54F), cgas_by (s.54(2), 54F(4)), ex_max (several exemptions on one sale).",
